<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Task> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#EvaluationMetric> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Evaluation Metric"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Hybrid> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Hybrid"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#hasFunction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has function"@en .
