<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#determines> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Training> .
_:N69593c7c023147e9be04906109c05d8b <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:N4c2e5f8572534629b22b8f87ed08b63b .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#isLabelled> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
