<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#isLabelled> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "The property 3.3.12 and 3.3.17 turn on. Stated on the data rather than derived from the presence of labels, so that a model can record the intent before the labels exist."@en .
<http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
