<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Annotation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The process of attaching a set of descriptive information to data without any change to that data."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Retraining> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 22989, 3.3.10. A model that records it can tell a deployed model from the one it replaced, which is what clause 6.2.7 and 6.2.8 ask for."@en .
