<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#" .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#DataSet> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Data Set"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AIComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 22989, 3.1.2.\n\nThe class is what a model needs as soon as one system carries more than one approach. A system combining a learned classifier with a rule-based decision has two components, each performing its own functions, and without them the two would be indistinguishable."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#basedOnLearning> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#hasSetting> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Hyperparameter> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Augmentation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The process of creating synthetic samples by modifying or utilizing the existing data."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Clustering> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
_:N3f5ef0bdbf544cdfafaf94685a9b66e9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Evaluation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "**Construct of this work.** Described in ISO/IEC 22989, clause 5.10 and clause 6.2.8, without an entry. It is what evaluation data, 3.2.14, exists for."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AIFunction> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "**Collecting class of this pattern.** The standard describes the activities in clause 5.10 and clause 6.2 without naming a superclass for them.\n\nNote that clause 8.3 of the standard uses the term AI function in a narrower sense, for computing a prediction alone. This class is broader on purpose, since a model has to record the whole life cycle rather than the operating step only."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Generation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Task> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#unit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#DataSet> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 22989, 3.2.5."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#hasRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Risk> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#usesData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a function to the data it works on."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Verification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 22989, 3.5.17. See the note on validation for the difference between the two."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Generation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Discussed in ISO/IEC 22989, clause 9.2, without an entry of its own."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#SemiSupervisedLearning> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Semi-supervised Machine Learning"@en .
_:N8444fd5a2924438f882b701dc2f1bda4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AISystem> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#VariableCharacteristic> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A named property of an AI system to which a model assigns a value, such as robustness or reliability."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#isValidatedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Validation> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Cloud> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Labelling> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Named in ISO/IEC 22989, clause 5.10, without an entry of its own. The step that produces what 3.2.10 defines and what supervised learning, 3.3.12, requires."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Model> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 22989, 3.1.23.\n\nBoth kinds of AI rest on models: 3.1.33 and 3.1.34 each reference this entry rather than the machine learning one. A rule-based system therefore instantiates this class and nothing below it."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#ValidationData> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Data used to compare the performance of different candidate models."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#hasHyperparameter> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#hasLabel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Label> .
_:N61b3de5c291b4a2c898e370e6a13dc21 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf> _:Na79016e8ff274ecebe3134a3cf290974 .
