<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Classification> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Named in note 2 to ISO/IEC 22989, 3.1.35, and discussed in clause 9, without an entry of its own."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Controllability> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
