<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#determines> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Task> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An action required to achieve a specific goal."@en .
