<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Clustering> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Named in note 2 to ISO/IEC 22989, 3.1.35, and discussed in clause 5.11.2, without an entry of its own."@en .
