<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#hasHyperparameter> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 22989, 3.3.4. Placed on the algorithm superclass, so a model algorithm and an evaluation algorithm may carry one as well.\n\nNot functional. An algorithm carries as many hyperparameters as it was set up with, and the value of each is reached from the hyperparameter by hasSetting."@en .
_:N1139b627b84548798cd65f99a59436a9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Data> .
