<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#determines> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 22989, 3.3.15 defines training as the process determining or improving the parameters. This relation is that determining, and it is what turns an algorithm into a model."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#SymbolicAI> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
