<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#UnsupervisedLearning> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 22989, 3.3.17."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Inference> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Reasoning by which conclusions are derived from known premises."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Regression> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Named in note 2 to ISO/IEC 22989, 3.1.35, without an entry of its own."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#consistsOfStep> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#DataProcessing> .
