<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AIFunction> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Algorithm> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#hasType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 22989, 3.1.33 and 3.1.34.\n\nDeliberately not functional. Clause 5.9 discusses combining the two approaches, so a system may carry both."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Controllability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Controllability"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#hasDataSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#DataSource> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AISystem> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 22989, 3.1.4. The entry adds that the system can use various techniques and approaches to develop a model representing data, knowledge or processes."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#realisedByModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "realised by model"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AIFunction> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#AISystem> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#isComposedOf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> _:N6dc0498a0fdb4ad29d89c6931b65657c .
_:Nbc06b554843e45f9a05ee0fe266f20b5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#TrainingAlgorithm> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "**Construct of this work.** ISO/IEC 22989, 3.3.6 defines the machine learning case of it, which this pattern carries as the subclass below."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Storing> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The function persisting data to a data sink, so that it stays available."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#hasDesign> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Functional: a system has one design, and a system split between two places is recorded as hybrid rather than as both."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#CharacteristicValue> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Data> .
