<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#hasDataSink> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "**Construct of this work**, after ISO/IEC 22989, clause 8.6.1."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#MachineLearning> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 22989, 3.3.5.\n\nModelled as a subclass of training rather than as a separate class: it is the case of training in which the parameters are optimised computationally. A symbolic system has a model without any training at all."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/status> "Draft"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#isEvaluatedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "is evaluated by"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#hasTask> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates an AI system to a task it addresses."@en .
