<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Generation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A task producing new outputs, such as text, images or audio, from learned representations."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#LearningType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "**Collecting class of this pattern.** The standard defines the four kinds below, 3.3.9, 3.3.11, 3.3.12 and 3.3.17, and discusses them in clause 5.11, but names no common superclass."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#creates> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "creates"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Filtering> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Named in ISO/IEC 22989, clause 5.10, among the preparation steps, without an entry of its own."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Sampling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Sampling"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Classification> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#determines> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a training to the model parameters it determines."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#hasFunction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates an AI system or a component to a function it performs."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#isExecutedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Both kinds of model execute inferences: 3.1.17 states that a premise is either a fact, a rule, a model, a feature or raw data."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Label> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Label"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#MLModel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A mathematical construct that generates an inference or prediction based on input data or information."@en .
