<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#ModelAlgorithm> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Model Algorithm"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#hasSetting> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a hyperparameter to the value chosen for it."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#hasCharacteristicValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#CharacteristicValue> .
