<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#Risk> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 22989, 3.5.11. Clause 6.2.2 asks stakeholders to assess risks across the whole life cycle, and this class is where a model records the result."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#unit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A literal rather than a reference to a unit ontology, so that the pattern stays free of further imports. Several qualities are dimensionless, in which case a model leaves this out."@en .
