<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#isLabelled> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#ReinforcementLearning> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Learning of an optimal sequence of actions to maximize a reward through interaction with an environment."@en .
