<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#SupervisedLearning> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 22989, 3.3.12. Whether the data carries a label, 3.2.10, is what separates this from unsupervised learning."@en .
