<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#CharacteristicValue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Reified so that a value can be referred to and annotated with its source or the conditions it holds under, in the same arrangement and for the same reason as the characteristic value of the IEC 60050-351 pattern.\n\nTwo relations end here and they run in opposite directions. A value points to the quality it quantifies through forCharacteristic, and a hyperparameter points to the value it was given through hasSetting. What separates them is where the value comes from: the first is established, the second is chosen."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#unit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "unit"@en .
